 r←Test_AuthBasic dummy;router;req1;req2;res2
 ⍝ http basic passes (UserID Password) to the hook and challenges with Basic when missing
 router←#.Mocks.NewAuthRouter
 '/me' router.Get ('WhoAmI' (security:,(basicAuth:⍬)))
 req1←⎕NEW #.Mocks.MockRequest ('GET' '/me')
 {}router._Dispatch req1
 req2←⎕NEW #.Mocks.MockRequest ('GET' '/me')
 req2.(UserID Password)←'alice' 'secret'
 res2←router._Dispatch req2
 r←(401=req1.Response.Status)∧(∨/'Basic realm='⍷∊req1.Response.Headers)
 r∧←(0=req2.Response.Status)∧('alice'≡res2.user)
